libmusiccast (1.0.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix mcctl preset play: it was parsed as the playback command.
  * Fail power, volume, and mute when the device returns a non-zero
    response_code, and say when the zone is in standby.

 -- Jasper Nevens <jasper.nevens@linux.com>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:15:00 +0100

libmusiccast (1.0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add mcctl input: show the current source, list choices, and select one
    (getStatus, getFeatures input_list, setInput).
  * Add playback controls for the current source: play, pause, stop, toggle,
    next, and previous (Net/USB and CD setPlayback; tuner switchPreset).
  * Print zone and input ids one per line, without a column header.

 -- Jasper Nevens <jasper.nevens@linux.com>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:19:00 +0100

libmusiccast (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add mcctl now-playing (YXC getPlayInfo for Net/USB, tuner, and CD).
  * Library: musiccast_now_playing() and play-info query helpers.

 -- Jasper Nevens <jasper.nevens@linux.com>  Thu,  5 Nov 2026 20:15:00 +0100

libmusiccast (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First stable upstream release (libmusiccast 1.0.0, mcctl CLI).
  * Binary packages: libmusiccast0 (library + mcctl), libmusiccast-dev.

